<title>POLAND: ELEKTRIM FEB NET RISES TO PLN 2.9 MLN.</title>
<headline>ELEKTRIM FEB NET RISES TO PLN 2.9 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results February</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.90 vs   2.59</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 4.09 vs   8.34</p>
<p> Operating profit     4.54 vs   5.86</p>
<p> Sales		   68.35 vs  70.64</p>
<p>JANUARY-FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     4.65 vs   5.03</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 7.46 vs  15.89</p>
<p> Operating profit     9.30 vs  11.99</p>
<p> Sales		  129.22 vs 115.16</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish industrial and trade</p>
<p>conglomerate is Elektrim SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
